## Expected Rollbar JSON Structure

The Rollbar JSON typically contains:
- `event`: The error event details
  - `body`: Error body with trace, message, etc.
  - `request`: HTTP request details
  - `server`: Server environment info
  - `client`: Client/browser info
- `occurrence_count`: How many times this error occurred
- `first_occurrence`: Timestamp of first occurrence
- `last_occurrence`: Timestamp of most recent occurrence

